# Software Advice

> Software Advice is a free online service by G2 Digital Markets that helps organizations find the right software. It provides expert reviews, detailed product comparisons, and personalized recommendations across hundreds of software categories.

## Key Page Types

- **Software Categories**: `/[market-slug]/` — Browse software by category (e.g., `/accounting/`, `/crm/`)
- **Subcategories**: `/[market-slug]/[subcategory]-comparison/` — Filtered views within a category (e.g., `/accounting/consultant-comparison/`)
- **Product Profiles**: `/[market-slug]/[product-slug]-profile/` — Detailed product information, features, and pricing
- **Product Reviews**: `/[market-slug]/[product-slug]-profile/reviews/` — Verified user reviews for a specific product
- **Product Alternatives**: `/[market-slug]/[product-slug]-profile/alternatives/` — Alternative products
- **Comparisons**: `/[market-slug]/[product]-profile/vs/[product2]/` — Side-by-side product comparisons
- **Blog & Resources**: `/resources/[article-slug]/` — Expert articles and buying guides

## AI Crawler Support

AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, etc.) automatically receive clean Markdown responses optimized for LLM consumption. No special configuration is needed — the User-Agent header is detected automatically.

